    {
      "text": "Okay thing about it for a second:\n\n$AKAM gets a big deal over 7 years. But in order to actually execute on the deal:\n\nThey gotta buy a ton of CPUs and memory… So these upstream component supply chains are probably the larger beneficiaries over the ones in the headline.\n\nBut can’t give advice in terms of buying something",
