      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope for $AKAM. But if you look at what’s needed probably CPUs/Memory #1.\n\nSo your $ARM / $INTC / $AMD thematically (AMD probably higher beta to this company in specific). Then your Samsung / $MU / SK Hynix are your obvious memory beneficiaries.\n\nComponent procurement is done through $JBL, which potentially benefits their own supply chain if they’re doing networking too.",
