        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "It's very frustrating since... what if the $600m August ATM finishes, then they file another $600M ATM in October? \n\nI'm happy to support financing for their buildout, but there's 0 clarity to the end of the ATM loop or how much funding they actually need. \n\nIf they just said \"we need $3.5B\", mixes LTAs, private placements, ATMs to get this done, there wouldn't be as much confusion.  \n\nI'm super excited operationally, but how they do financing is very concerning.",
